#: ../developer/adding-models.md:1
msgid "Adding a New Model"
msgstr "添加新模型"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide is for operators who want a gateway to serve another model. If"
" the provider is one the gateway already supports — any OpenAI-compatible"
" API, OpenRouter, Anthropic, Claude on Vertex or Gemini — this is "
"configuration only: add an entry to the model registry, set its "
"credential, and restart."
msgstr ""
"本指南写给想让网关多提供一个模型的运维人员。如果网关已经支持这个 provider（任何 OpenAI 兼容 "
"API、OpenRouter、Anthropic、Vertex 上的 Claude 或 "
"Gemini），只需要改配置：在模型注册表里加一个条目，配好凭据，然后重启。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:8
msgid ""
"For a model you serve yourself on vLLM, SGLang, or Ollama, see [Adding a "
"New Local Model](add-local-model.md)."
msgstr "如果是你自己用 vLLM、SGLang 或 Ollama 部署的模型，见[添加新的本地模型](add-local-model.md)。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:10
msgid ""
"For a provider with its own, non-OpenAI API, you need an adapter first; "
"see [Writing a Provider Adapter](provider-adapters.md)."
msgstr ""
"如果 provider 有自己的一套非 OpenAI API，需要先写一个 adapter；见[编写 provider adapter"
"](provider-adapters.md)。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:12
msgid ""
"When a database is configured, a model, a route or a key can also be "
"added from the admin console while the gateway runs; see [Runtime "
"configuration from the admin console](configuration.md#runtime-"
"configuration-from-the-admin-console). A model created there has no "
"catalog metadata, so a model that needs a context length, modalities or "
"aliases still belongs in the registry."
msgstr ""
"配置了数据库时，也可以在网关运行期间从管理控制台添加模型、路由或 key；见[从管理控制台做运行时配置](configuration.md"
"#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-"
"console)。不过在控制台创建的模型没有模型目录所需的元数据，所以需要设置上下文长度、模态或别名的模型，还是要写进注册表。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:18
msgid "Where your model registry lives"
msgstr "模型注册表在哪里"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:20
msgid ""
"The gateway uses the file named by `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`; failing that, "
"the one named by an active distribution manifest; failing both, the "
"bundled example `config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml`. [How a gateway "
"finds its config](configuration.md#how-a-gateway-finds-its-config) has "
"the details."
msgstr ""
"网关使用 `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH` 指定的文件；没设置时，用已启用的发行版 manifest "
"指定的文件；两者都没有时，用自带的示例 "
"`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml`。详见[网关如何找到自己的配置](configuration.md#how-a"
"-gateway-finds-its-config)。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:26
msgid "That leaves two ways to set up your own:"
msgstr "因此，要使用自己的注册表，有两种做法："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:28
msgid ""
"**Point at a file.** Keep your registry wherever you like and set "
"`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH=/path/to/models.yaml`. This is what the quickstart in"
" `README.md` does."
msgstr ""
"**指向一个文件**。注册表放在任意位置，设置 `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH=/path/to/models.yaml` "
"即可。`README.md` 里的快速开始就是这么做的。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:31
msgid ""
"**Ship a distribution.** Create `distributions/<name>/` containing a "
"`distribution.yaml` manifest and a `config/models.yaml`, then set "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH=distributions/<name>/distribution.yaml` and "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`. `distributions/example/` is a working "
"distribution you can copy; `config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` is"
" an annotated manifest."
msgstr ""
"**建一个发行版**。创建 `distributions/<name>/`，里面放一份 `distribution.yaml` manifest "
"和一份 `config/models.yaml`，然后设置 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH=distributions/<name>/distribution.yaml` 和 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`。`distributions/example/` "
"是一个可以直接复制的可用发行版；`config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` 是一份带注释的 "
"manifest。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:38
msgid ""
"Throughout this guide, \"your model registry\" means whichever file that "
"resolution picks."
msgstr "本指南中所说的「你的模型注册表」，指的就是上述解析过程最终选中的那个文件。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:41
msgid ""
"If no registry is found at the resolved path, the backend logs an error, "
"serves an empty `/v1/models`, and reports every model as not found."
msgstr "如果解析出的路径上没有注册表，后端会记一条错误日志，`/v1/models` 返回空列表，请求任何模型都会报 not found。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:44
msgid "Adding a model"
msgstr "添加模型"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:46
msgid "**Add a model entry** to your model registry:"
msgstr "在模型注册表中**添加一条模型条目**："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:76
msgid ""
"The route inherits `base_url` and `api_key` from the model, so it only "
"has to carry what differs. Repeat them on a route entry when a second "
"route points somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"路由会继承模型的 `base_url` 和 "
"`api_key`，所以路由上只需写不一样的部分。如果第二条路由指向别的地址，就在那条路由上把这两项再写一遍。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:80
msgid ""
"**Set the environment variables** in `.env` at the repository root (the "
"backend's settings loader reads that file):"
msgstr "在仓库根目录的 `.env` 里**设置环境变量**（后端的配置加载器读的就是这个文件）："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:88
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If a `${VAR}` used for `api_key`, `api_keys` or `base_url` is unset or "
"empty, the gateway skips the whole model and logs which variable was "
"missing. Mark a route `optional: true` to skip only that route instead."
msgstr ""
"如果 `api_key`、`api_keys` 或 `base_url` 用到的某个 `${VAR}` "
"没有设置或为空，网关会跳过整个模型，并在日志里写明缺的是哪个变量。给路由加上 `optional: true`，就只跳过那一条路由。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:92
msgid "**Restart the backend** to load the new model."
msgstr "**重启后端**以加载新模型。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:94
msgid "**Verify** it, as described below."
msgstr "按下文的方法**验证**它。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:96
msgid ""
"Note on aliases: to let clients also call the model under a second name —"
" an OpenRouter-style vendor slug, or the raw model path your serving "
"runtime uses — list those names in `aliases`. They resolve to the same "
"routes."
msgstr ""
"关于别名：如果想让客户端也能用另一个名字调用这个模型，比如 OpenRouter 风格的厂商 "
"slug，或者你的推理运行时使用的原始模型路径，就把这些名字列进 `aliases`。它们会解析到同一组路由。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:100
msgid "Verify it through the gateway"
msgstr "通过网关验证"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:102
msgid "Start the backend. From a source checkout:"
msgstr "启动后端。直接从源码运行时："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:109
msgid ""
"With the bundled Docker Compose setup, `make build s=backend` rebuilds "
"and restarts the backend instead."
msgstr "如果用仓库自带的 Docker Compose，则改用 `make build s=backend` 重新构建并重启后端。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:112
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/models` accepts an anonymous request — it resolves an API key "
"only to decide whether to include admin-visible entries:"
msgstr "`GET /v1/models` 接受匿名请求——它解析 API key 只是为了决定要不要包含仅管理员可见的条目："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:119
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/chat/completions` **returns 401 without a valid gateway API "
"key** unless the backend is running with `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false`. Send "
"the key you issued for your own gateway (this is the gateway's key, not "
"the upstream provider's):"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/chat/completions` **没有有效的网关 API key 就会返回 401**，除非后端以 "
"`USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false` 运行。请求时要带上你在自己网关上签发的 key（是网关的 key，不是上游 provider "
"的）："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:135
msgid "Streaming test:"
msgstr "流式测试："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:149
msgid "Configuration Reference"
msgstr "配置参考"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:151
msgid "Model fields"
msgstr "模型字段"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:153
msgid ""
"These keys can appear on a model entry. Most of them can also be set on a"
" route entry, where the route value wins; `id` and `name` identify the "
"model itself and are read only at the model level."
msgstr "这些键可以写在模型条目上。其中大多数也可以写在路由条目上，此时以路由上的值为准；`id` 和 `name` 标识的是模型本身，只在模型层级读取。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Type"
msgstr "类型"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Required"
msgstr "必填"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`id`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "string"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Unique model identifier; the name clients send"
msgstr "唯一的模型标识；客户端发送的就是这个名字"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`name`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Display name"
msgstr "展示名称"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`provider`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Provider/adapter kind; also the default `route[].kind` when no `route:` "
"list is given. Note the collision: at the model level `provider:` selects"
" an adapter, while `provider:` on a *route* is only an analytics label — "
"see the route-fields table"
msgstr ""
"provider/adapter 的 kind；没有写 `route:` 列表时，它也是 `route[].kind` "
"的默认值。注意这里有个同名的坑：模型层级的 `provider:` 用来选 adapter，而*路由*上的 `provider:` "
"只是统计用的标签——见路由字段表"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`base_url`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Yes, here or on every route"
msgstr "是，写在这里或每条路由上"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "API endpoint base URL"
msgstr "API 端点的 base URL"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`api_key`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "API authentication key"
msgstr "API 鉴权密钥"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`provider_model_id`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Provider's model identifier (overrides `id` on the wire)"
msgstr "provider 那边的模型标识（实际发给上游时用它代替 `id`）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`model_type`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"`\"chat\"` (default) or `\"embedding\"`. The alias `type:` is equivalent;"
" embedding models bypass the weighted router and use their routes as an "
"ordered fallback chain"
msgstr ""
"`\"chat\"`（默认）或 `\"embedding\"`。也可以写成 `type:`，两者等价；embedding 模型不走加权 "
"router，而是按顺序把自己的路由当作回退链"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`aliases`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "list[string]"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Alternative names for routing"
msgstr "可用于路由的其他名称"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`quantization`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Quantization format (default: `\"bf16\"`)"
msgstr "量化格式（默认：`\"bf16\"`）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`input_modalities`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Input types: `\"text\"`, `\"image\"`"
msgstr "输入类型：`\"text\"`、`\"image\"`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`output_modalities`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Output types: `\"text\"`"
msgstr "输出类型：`\"text\"`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`context_length`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "int"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Maximum context window (default: 8192)"
msgstr "最大上下文窗口（默认：8192）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`max_output_length`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Maximum output tokens (default: 4096); `max_tokens` is clamped to it"
msgstr "最大输出 token 数（默认：4096）；`max_tokens` 超过它时会被压到这个值"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`supports_tools`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "bool"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Function calling support (default: false)"
msgstr "是否支持 function calling（默认：false）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`supports_structured_output`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "JSON mode support (default: false)"
msgstr "是否支持 JSON mode（默认：false）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`supported_params`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Allowed parameter names (default: `temperature`, `top_p`, `max_tokens`)"
msgstr "允许的参数名（默认：`temperature`、`top_p`、`max_tokens`）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`reasoning_efforts`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"The values this model's `reasoning_effort` accepts. Meaningful only when "
"`reasoning_effort` is in `supported_params`; empty means \"not offered\"."
" It has no default, because the accepted values differ from model to "
"model"
msgstr ""
"这个模型的 `reasoning_effort` 接受哪些取值。只有当 `reasoning_effort` 在 "
"`supported_params` 里时才有意义；为空表示「不提供」。它没有默认值，因为各模型接受的取值不同"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`on_demand`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Model is lazily loaded on shared GPUs (started on first request, stopped "
"when idle). Exposed in `/v1/models`, and the RouteWise background latency"
" prober never probes such endpoints (default: false)"
msgstr ""
"模型在共享 GPU 上按需加载（首次请求时启动，空闲时停止）。这个标记会在 `/v1/models` 中返回，RouteWise "
"的后台延迟探测器也从不探测这类端点（默认：false）"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`processor`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Output-processor override for `OpenAICompatAdapter`, bypassing model-ID "
"auto-detection. Accepted: `\"default\"`, `\"glm\"`, `\"qwen_coder\"`, "
"`\"think_block\"`"
msgstr ""
"为 `OpenAICompatAdapter` 指定输出处理器，绕过按模型 id "
"的自动识别。可取值：`\"default\"`、`\"glm\"`、`\"qwen_coder\"`、`\"think_block\"`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`extra_body`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "dict"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Default fields merged into OpenAI-compatible upstream request bodies. "
"Core fields and validated client parameters win"
msgstr "合并进 OpenAI 兼容上游请求体的默认字段。核心字段和已校验的客户端参数优先"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`priority_scheduling`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"The endpoint runs an sglang server started with `--enable-priority-"
"scheduling`; see [Prioritizing decode on an sglang route](add-local-"
"model.md#prioritizing-decode-on-an-sglang-route). Normally set per route,"
" not per model"
msgstr ""
"该端点上的 sglang 服务器是带 `--enable-priority-scheduling` 启动的；见[在 sglang 路由上优先调度 "
"decode](add-local-model.md#prioritizing-decode-on-an-sglang-"
"route)。通常按路由设置，而不是按模型设置"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`route_metadata`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Free-form per-route metadata consumed by routing strategies"
msgstr "每条路由上的自由格式元数据，供路由策略读取"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`pricing`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Base cost information. `prompt`, `completion`, `input_cache_reads` and "
"`input_cache_writes` are USD per 1M tokens; `request` is USD per request "
"and `image` USD per image"
msgstr ""
"基础价格。`prompt`、`completion`、`input_cache_reads` 和 `input_cache_writes` "
"的单位是美元/100 万 token；`request` 的单位是美元/次请求，`image` 是美元/张图片"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`pricing_schedule`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"UTC-only activation time plus recurring daily price windows: `pricing` "
"stays active before `effective_at`; afterwards `default` applies outside "
"each half-open `[start, end)` window, and a window's own `pricing` "
"overrides the base fields"
msgstr ""
"一个生效时间（只支持 UTC），加上每天循环的价格时段：`effective_at` 之前一直用 `pricing`；之后，不在任何左闭右开的 "
"`[start, end)` 时段内时用 `default`，落在某个时段内时，用该时段自己的 `pricing` 覆盖基础字段"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:184
msgid ""
"A model entry also accepts `route` (below), `router` and `router_params` "
"(see [Choosing a router per model](routing.md#choosing-a-router-per-"
"model)), and `required_role`, the lowest user role that can see and call "
"the model (`admin_only: true` is an older way to write `required_role: "
"admin`)."
msgstr ""
"模型条目还接受 `route`（见下文）、`router` 和 `router_params`（见[为每个模型选择 "
"router](routing.md#choosing-a-router-per-model)），以及 "
"`required_role`——能看到并调用该模型的最低用户角色（`admin_only: true` 是 `required_role: "
"admin` 的旧写法）。"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:189
msgid "Route configuration"
msgstr "路由配置"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:191
msgid "Routes give one model several endpoints with weighted distribution:"
msgstr "路由让一个模型拥有多个端点，并按权重分配流量："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md:208
msgid "Beyond the model fields above, a route entry accepts:"
msgstr "除上面的模型字段之外，路由条目还接受："

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`kind`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "Adapter kind (see below). Defaults to the model's `provider`"
msgstr "adapter 的 kind（见下）。默认取模型的 `provider`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`weight`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "float"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Relative share of traffic (default 1.0). `0` keeps the route configured "
"but unused: it is not tried even as a fallback"
msgstr "流量的相对占比（默认 1.0）。`0` 表示保留这条路由的配置但不使用：连回退时都不会尝试它"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`api_keys`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Key pool for this endpoint, instead of `api_key`. Setting both is an "
"error. The whole pool is one endpoint for latency and quota accounting; "
"split genuinely separate resources into separate routes"
msgstr ""
"这个端点的 key 池，用来替代 "
"`api_key`。两者同时设置会报错。在延迟统计和配额记账上，整个池算作一个端点；真正互相独立的资源要拆成不同的路由"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`embeddings_path`"
msgstr "`embeddings_path`"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"OpenAI-compatible embeddings path appended to this route's `base_url`; a "
"leading slash is optional. Omitted, null, or empty keeps the default URL "
"inference"
msgstr ""
"拼在该路由 `base_url` 后面的 OpenAI 兼容 embeddings 路径；开头的斜杠可有可无。不写、写 null "
"或空字符串时，仍按默认规则推导 URL"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`optional`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Skip this route with a warning when a `${VAR}`-backed key, `base_url`, or"
" `embeddings_path` resolves unset or blank"
msgstr "如果 key、`base_url` 或 `embeddings_path` 引用的 `${VAR}` 未设置或解析为空白，就跳过这条路由并记一条警告"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`provider` / `provider_display_name`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid ""
"Analytics label override only — it renames the row in the dashboard and "
"does **not** select an adapter; that is `kind`. See [Naming a route in "
"the dashboard](add-local-model.md#naming-a-route-in-the-dashboard)"
msgstr ""
"只覆盖分析统计里的标签——它重命名的是仪表盘里的那一行，**不会**选择 adapter，选 adapter 的是 "
"`kind`。见[在仪表盘中给路由命名](add-local-model.md#naming-a-route-in-the-dashboard)"

#: ../developer/adding-models.md
msgid "`provider_type`"
msgstr ""

