#~ msgid "Deployment-local adapters"
#~ msgstr "部署本地适配器"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "A deployment can register a local "
#~ "factory without editing the built-in "
#~ "dispatch. Its module exposes a "
#~ "synchronous, no-argument `register()` "
#~ "function:"
#~ msgstr "部署可以注册本地工厂，而不修改内置分派逻辑。模块需要提供同步、无参数的 `register()` 函数："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Set `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` to this module's "
#~ "import name and use `kind: "
#~ "example_service` in the model registry. "
#~ "The factory receives the route's "
#~ "configuration dictionary and returns an "
#~ "adapter. It runs before built-in "
#~ "provider defaults, so it must supply "
#~ "any profile or path defaults it "
#~ "needs. Duplicate registrations fail; replacing"
#~ " a built-in kind requires "
#~ "`register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, override=True)`"
#~ " and is logged. See [Backend "
#~ "extensions](distribution-customization.md#4-backend-"
#~ "extensions) for the startup and "
#~ "deployment requirements."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "将 `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 设置为该模块的导入名称，并在模型注册表中使用 `kind:"
#~ " "
#~ "example_service`。工厂接收路由配置字典并返回适配器。它在内置提供商默认值应用之前运行，因此必须自行提供所需的使用配置或路径默认值。重复注册会失败；替换内置类型需要调用"
#~ " `register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, "
#~ "override=True)`，并会记录日志。启动和部署要求见[后端扩展](distribution-"
#~ "customization.md#4-backend-extensions)。"

